OL,4,A'Pancho' Locke dies aged 47
OL,5,
OL,6,FSan Portablo, co-owned by Locke, said
OL,7,Fthe TV star was an "absolute Welsh
OL,8,Ftreasure" who "lived an incredible
OL,9,Flife".
